OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start to the week with
OL,6,Frain persisting through much of the
OL,7,Fmorning. Rain heavy at times at first,
OL,8,Fthen becoming light and patchy by the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds pick up through the
OL,10,Fmorning with coastal gales possible
OL,11,Flater.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening, then a
OL,14,Fband of heavy rain sweeps through
OL,15,Fquickly overnight, only lingering in
OL,16,Fthe east by dawn. Very strong winds,
OL,17,Fturning to gales at the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
