OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FOnce lingering rain clears, a
OL,6,Fbright and breezy day follows with
OL,7,Fisolated showers and plenty of sunny
OL,8,Fspells. Feeling fresh in the strong
OL,9,Fbreeze, this easing through the
OL,10,Fafternoon.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FDry
OL,13,Fwith sunny spells and easing winds
OL,14,FWednesday. Overnight cloud or fog
OL,15,Fclears to sunny spells and light winds
OL,16,FThursday, then cloud starts to build
OL,17,Fagain Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
